The TAB elections are now complete. Thank you to all the candidates for
putting their names forward, and a big thank you to Chris Mason, Kevin
Hilman, Guenter Rocke, Tim Bird, and the Linux Foundation staff who helped
handle election logistics.

With 56 ballots cast, the top 5 candidates received:
Jon Corbet, 41 votes
Greg Kroah-Hartman, 28 votes
Steven Rostedt, 25 votes
Shuah Kahn, 22 votes
Theodore Ts'o, 22 votes

The next highest voted candidate received 19 votes.

Full results are available on request.

Thanks again to everyone who participated, and congratulations to the
elected candidates.

g.

